{
	"name": "Protective Pollen",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/plant-undersea-seaweed-glow-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You draw forth the pollen of wildflowers to debilitate your foes. When you are hit with a melee weapon attack, as a reaction you may conjure forth a cloud of pollen in a 15-foot cone originating from you. Creatures within the area of effect must succeed on a Constitution saving throw versus your spell save DC or become [[/condition id=blinded]] until the start of your next turn. Creatures who fail their save by 5 or more also become [[/condition id=incapacitated]] by coughing and sneezing. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a short or a long rest.</p>",
